  "reasoning": "The defendant Xu concealed the fact that the house had already been sold to another party and misrepresented his ownership to the victim Wei, inducing Wei to pay 480,000 RMB for the house. This conduct constitutes deception for illegal gain, fitting the legal definition of fraud (诈骗罪). No other criminal elements such as theft, illegal hunting, or drug-related offenses are present. Therefore, the appropriate charge is fraud alone.",
